{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"What my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nI love to be loved, but on my own terms! Let's brush up on some canine body language together!\n\nI'm ready to learn! I need a patient person who has the time to work on training with me.\n\nI am excitable and energetic! I will need positive outlets for my energy!\n\nI would do best in a home with only adult humans.\n\nI am a playgroup rockstar!\n\nA Volunteer Wrote: We are all so charmed by this amazing goofball, who is so great on a leash and up for absolutely any adventure, especially if it involves going to the park and being pet, getting treats, and sitting on your feet to watch the world in action (he showed no responsiveness to passing dogs.) If I stopped petting him he would gently lick my hand to let me know I was failing in my duties. My real duty: Convincing someone to come to the shelter and taking this wonderful, giant-hearted boy home for a life time of pets and romping!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=14&searchType=4&animalid=203613","id":"b8cb5d7ba21fa52d10d6f59b2987dd5e","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f6a1676b23d74b3596e8323a7e0fc3d5-1789261182-1789261191-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8d0c0124d7804cd0bf203be1b173e319-1789261162-1789261162-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7663eb45ab5a431ea5b1d54b5564fc2b-1788879181-1788879181-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2d730429bfe84e649c6e22e3fa5b0b08-1788879181-1788879181-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ac15c1c8be9c48ad9a50cff3298620b2-1788879115-1788879115-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelter